COMMENT ON COLUMN MBW_APPROVAL_DELEGATION.approval_type IS '제한 결재 유형; NULL이면 공통';
COMMENT ON COLUMN MBW_APPROVAL_DELEGATION.valid_from IS '위임 시작시각';
